# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository AND in working trees.
#
# Without this, a checkout on Windows gets CRLF (core.autocrlf=true is the
# default there), and `prettier --check` then fails on every file — which is
# exactly what happened on the windows-latest CI leg while passing locally,
# because a local working tree that prettier has already written is LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Lockfiles and generated output: leave alone.
bun.lock -diff linguist-generated
